Dear {!Contact.FirstName},
The ID Card Priority Task displayed on MyASU is an auto-generated task for all new students. The Sun Card Office cannot clear this task for you. To clear the task, click on the task, a drop down will appear. At the bottom of the drop down click “Don’t Show This Again.”
Regards, {!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
Sun Devil Card Services Arizona State University Phone: 480-965-2273 cardservices.asu.edu
If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.
